<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$30 mln.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES-Tenders total A$30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Australian promissory note issuers, both hawking 30-day paper, reaped a total of A$30 million via tenders on Wednesday.</p>
<p>MLC Building Society made the larger issue, selling A$20 million of early May notes at two basis points over BBSW.</p>
<p>At 0125 GMT (11.25 a.m.), June bill futures were unchanged at 93.85.</p>
